      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm still checking my phone. every time it buzzes i just feel this sick wave in my stomach. it's like everyone i've ever known has just collectively decided i don't exist anymore, or worse, that i'm someone i don't recognize. i look in the mirror and i don't see myself. i just see the person everyone's screaming about online. it's like i'm already a ghost.",
