      "content": "\"let go\" ... what does that even mean to you? because when i say i feel like a ghost, i mean it. i feel like my life is already over. there's no coming back from this. even if I never post again, the damage is done. the \"peace\" you're talking about... it feels like it's not even something I can find in this world anymore.",
